{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://flightctl.local/contracts/v2/gpu-probe.schema.json",
  "title": "Flightctl GPU probe v2: inventory observation and occupancy observation",
  "description": "SPLIT (Grok finding 3/4): the single v1 GPUProbe.inspect returned two incompatible shapes. v2 has InventoryProbe (what cards exist) and OccupancyProbe (who is on the lane's cards now), each with the REAL nvidia-smi query it parses (x-real-commands; field names measured on driver 610.57.04 with nvidia-smi --help-query-gpu / --help-query-compute-apps, 2 Oct). Any failure, timeout, '[N/A]'-only row or unparsable output is status 'unknown' with a reason: never empty, never free.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/inventory_observation"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/occupancy_observation"
    }
  ],
  "x-real-commands": {
    "inventory": "nvidia-smi --query-gpu=index,uuid,pci.bus_id,name,memory.total,driver_version --format=csv,noheader,nounits",
    "numa": "cat /sys/bus/pci/devices/<pci_bus_id normalised>/numa_node",
    "occupancy_gpus": "nvidia-smi --query-gpu=uuid,memory.used,memory.total,utilization.gpu,temperature.gpu,power.draw,enforced.power.limit,clocks_event_reasons.hw_thermal_slowdown,clocks_event_reasons.sw_thermal_slowdown,ecc.errors.uncorrected.volatile.total --format=csv,noheader,nounits",
    "occupancy_processes": "nvidia-smi --query-compute-apps=gpu_uuid,pid,process_name,used_memory --format=csv,noheader,nounits",
    "device_minor": "grep 'Device Minor' /proc/driver/nvidia/gpus/<pci_bus_id normalised>/information   (maps the card to /dev/nvidia<minor> for device-cgroup isolation; measured on driver 610.57.04, 2 Oct)",
    "notes": "Values may be '[N/A]' or '[Not Supported]' (ECC on Titan RTX reads '[N/A]', measured): map to null for that field, never to zero. clocks_event_reasons.* print 'Active'/'Not Active' (measured). pci.bus_id prints an 8-digit uppercase domain; normalise to 4-digit lowercase. process_name is the FULL command line on driver 610 (measured: a browser GPU process line of ~900 characters) and may contain ', ': parse a process row as uuid, pid = first two fields and used_memory = LAST field; everything between is the name. Compute-apps lists compute contexts only: graphics/display memory shows in memory.used with no process row (measured: 529 MiB used, zero process rows on a display-driving card). Every command runs with a bounded timeout (default 10 s).",
    "emptiness_rule": "B2 (Sol 6). A lane is EMPTY only if: status ok; tenants empty; NO process attributed to the lease; and unexplained_mib < lane_noise_mib, where unexplained_mib = sum(memory.used over the lane's cards) - sum(used_memory of processes attributed to the lease or classed as noise). A held lane is in COLLISION when tenants is non-empty or unexplained_mib >= lane_noise_mib (watcher rule; legacy thresholds 512/1024 MiB). A process row whose used_memory is null ('[N/A]', e.g. no permission / other namespace) is a TENANT unless attributed to the lease: unknown memory never counts as noise. The executor computes 'empty'; tests/contracts_v2/validation.py occupancy_semantics() is the oracle and golden captures from real cards are the evidence. Round 3 (Sol 6 B2 counterexample): processes is PARTITIONED: every process is exactly one of lease (attribution lease), noise (attribution noise, used_memory known and < process_noise_mib) or tenant (attribution external); tenants == the external processes and noise == the noise processes, in order; a process with unknown memory can never be noise and can never leave empty true. occupancy_semantics() enforces the partition."
  },
  "$defs": {
    "status": {
      "enum": [
        "ok",
        "unknown"
      ]
    },
    "inventory_device": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "index",
        "uuid",
        "pci_bus_id",
        "name",
        "memory_total_mib",
        "driver_version",
        "numa_node",
        "device_minor"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "index": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "uuid": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^GPU-[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
        },
        "pci_bus_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{4}:[0-9a-f]{2}:[0-9a-f]{2}\\.[0-7]$"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "memory_total_mib": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "driver_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "numa_node": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "device_minor": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 255
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "/proc/driver/nvidia/gpus/<bus>/information 'Device Minor' -> /dev/nvidia<minor>; null = unknown (device isolation for the lane is then refused)."
        }
      }
    },
    "inventory_observation": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "host_id",
        "observed_at",
        "status",
        "reason",
        "vendor",
        "devices"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "gpu-inventory"
        },
        "host_id": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/short_identifier"
        },
        "observed_at": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/utc_time"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/status"
        },
        "reason": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/nullable_text"
        },
        "vendor": {
          "enum": [
            "nvidia",
            "none",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "devices": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/inventory_device"
          }
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "unknown"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "reason": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "devices": {
                "maxItems": 0
              },
              "vendor": {
                "const": "unknown"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "vendor": {
                "const": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "ok"
              },
              "devices": {
                "maxItems": 0
              },
              "reason": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "gpu_sample": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "uuid",
        "memory_used_mib",
        "memory_total_mib",
        "utilization_pct",
        "temperature_c",
        "power_draw_w",
        "power_limit_w",
        "thermal_slowdown",
        "ecc_uncorrected"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "uuid": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/inventory_device/properties/uuid"
        },
        "memory_used_mib": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "memory_total_mib": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "utilization_pct": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 100
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "temperature_c": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 130
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "power_draw_w": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "power_limit_w": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "thermal_slowdown": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ecc_uncorrected": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "gpu_process": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "gpu_uuid",
        "pid",
        "process_name",
        "used_memory_mib",
        "attribution"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "gpu_uuid": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/inventory_device/properties/uuid"
        },
        "pid": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "process_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 4096
        },
        "used_memory_mib": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "attribution": {
          "description": "Set by the executor, not the probe: lease (inside the lease's unit cgroup or a registered holder pid), noise (below process_noise_mib), external (anything else).",
          "enum": [
            "unattributed",
            "lease",
            "noise",
            "external"
          ]
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "attribution": {
                "const": "noise"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "used_memory_mib": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "occupancy_observation": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "host_id",
        "lane_id",
        "observed_at",
        "status",
        "reason",
        "expected_uuids",
        "gpus",
        "processes",
        "tenants",
        "noise",
        "lane_memory_used_mib",
        "thresholds",
        "unexplained_mib",
        "empty"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "gpu-occupancy"
        },
        "host_id": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/short_identifier"
        },
        "lane_id": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/short_identifier"
        },
        "observed_at": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/utc_time"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/status"
        },
        "reason": {
          "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/nullable_text"
        },
        "gpus": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/gpu_sample"
          },
          "description": "One sample per expected lane card (status ok)."
        },
        "processes": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/gpu_process"
          }
        },
        "tenants": {
          "description": "Unattributed processes on the lane's cards with used_memory >= process_noise_mib OR used_memory unknown (null). Unknown memory is never noise.",
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/gpu_process"
          }
        },
        "noise": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/gpu_process"
          }
        },
        "lane_memory_used_mib": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "thresholds": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "process_noise_mib",
            "lane_noise_mib"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "process_noise_mib": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "lane_noise_mib": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "unexplained_mib": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Sum of memory.used over the lane's cards minus memory of lease-attributed and noise processes; null when status is unknown."
        },
        "empty": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "The ONLY GPU-empty proof (x-real-commands.emptiness_rule). Consistency with the numbers is checked by occupancy_semantics()."
        },
        "expected_uuids": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/inventory_device/properties/uuid"
          },
          "description": "Round 4 (Sol 6 r3 B2): the lane's card UUIDs from the confirmed inventory. With status ok, gpus must cover exactly these (all present, none extra, no duplicates) and every process must be on one of them; occupancy_semantics() enforces it."
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "unknown"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "reason": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "tenants": {
                "maxItems": 0
              },
              "gpus": {
                "maxItems": 0
              },
              "empty": {
                "const": false
              },
              "unexplained_mib": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "ok"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "gpus": {
                "minItems": 1
              },
              "unexplained_mib": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "lane_memory_used_mib": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "empty": {
                "const": true
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "ok"
              },
              "tenants": {
                "maxItems": 0
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
